{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"遼有國樂，有雅樂，有大樂，有散樂，有鐃歌、橫吹樂。舊史稱聖宗、興宗咸通音律，聲氣、歌辭、舞節，徵諸太常、儀鳳、教坊不可得。按紀、志、遼朝雜禮，參考史籍，定其可知者，以補一代之闕文。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"嗚呼！咸、韶、夏、武之樂，聲亡書逸，河間作記，史遷因以為書，寥乎希哉。遼之樂觀此足矣。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"國樂","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"遼有國樂，猶先王之風；其諸國樂，猶諸侯之風。故志其略。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"正月朔日朝賀，用宮懸雅樂。元會，用大樂；曲破後，用散樂；角觝終之。是夜，皇帝燕飲，用國樂。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"七月十三日，皇帝出行宮三十里卓帳。十四日設宴，應從諸軍隨各部落動樂。十五日中元，大宴，用漢樂。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"春飛放杏堝，皇帝射獲頭鵝，薦廟燕飲，樂工數十人執小樂器侑酒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"諸國樂","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"太宗會同三年，晉宣徽使楊端、王朓等及諸國使朝見，皇帝御便殿賜宴。端、朓起進酒，作歌舞，上為舉觴極歡。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"會同三年端午日，百僚及諸國使稱賀，如式燕飲，命回鶻、燉煌二使作本國舞。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"天祚天慶二年，駕幸混同江，頭魚酒筵，半酣，上命諸酋長次第歌舞為樂。女直阿骨打端立直視，辭以不能。上謂蕭奉先曰：「阿骨打意氣雄豪，顧視不常，可託以邊事誅之。不然，恐貽後患。」奉先奏：「阿骨打無大過，殺之傷向化之意。蕞爾小國，又何能為。」","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"雅樂","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"自漢以後，相承雅樂，有古頌焉，有古大雅焉。遼闕郊廟禮，無頌樂。大同元年，太宗自汴將還，得晉太常樂譜、宮懸、樂架，委所司先赴中京。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"聖宗太平元年，尊號冊禮：設宮懸於殿庭，舉麾位在殿第三重西階之上，協律郎各入就舉麾位，太常博士引太常卿，太常卿引皇帝。將仗動，協律郎舉麾，太樂令令撞黃鍾之鍾，左右鍾皆應。工人舉柷，樂作；皇帝即御坐，扇合，樂止。王公入門，樂作；至位，樂止。通事舍人引押冊大臣，初動，樂作；置冊殿前香案訖，就位，樂止。舁冊官奉冊，初動，樂作；升殿，置冊御坐前，就西墉北上位，樂止。大臣上殿，樂作；至殿欄內位，樂止。大臣降殿階，樂作；復位，樂止。王公三品以上出，樂作；太常博士引太常卿，太常卿引皇帝降御坐入閤，樂止。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"興宗重熙九年，上契丹冊，皇帝出，奏隆安之樂。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"聖宗統和元年，冊承天皇太后，設宮懸，簨虡，太樂工、協律郎入。太后儀衛動，舉麾，太和樂作；太樂令、太常卿導引昇御坐，簾捲，樂止。文武三品以上入，舒和樂作；至位，樂止。皇帝入門，雍和樂作；至殿前位，樂止。宰相押冊，皇帝隨冊，樂作；至殿前置冊於案，樂止。翰林學士、大將軍舁冊，樂作；置御坐前，樂止。丞相上殿，樂作；至讀冊位，樂止。皇帝下殿，樂作；至位，樂止。太后宣答訖，樂作；皇帝至西閤，樂止。親王、丞相上殿，樂作；退班出，樂止。下簾，樂作；皇太后入內，樂止。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"冊皇太子儀：太子初入門，貞安之樂作。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"冊禮樂工次第：四隅各置建鼓一虡，樂工各一人；宮懸每面九虡，每虡樂工一人；樂虡近北置柷、敔各一，樂工各一人；樂虡內坐部樂工，左右各一百二人；樂虡西南武舞六十四人，執小旗二人；樂虡東南文舞六十四人，執小旗二人；協律郎二人；太樂令一人。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"唐十二和樂，遼初用之：豫和祀天神，順和祭地祇，永和享宗廟，肅和登歌奠玉帛，雍和入俎接神，壽和酌獻飲神，太和節升降，舒和節出入，昭和舉酒，休和以飯，正和皇后受冊以行，承和太子以行。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"遼十二安樂：初，梁改唐十二和樂為九慶樂，後唐建唐宗廟，仍用十二和樂，晉改為十二同樂。遼雜禮：「天子出入，奏隆安；太子行，奏貞安。」則是遼嘗改樂名矣。餘十安樂名缺。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"遼雅樂歌辭，文闕不具；八音器數，大抵因唐之舊。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"八音：","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"金　鎛、鍾。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"石　球、磬。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"絲　琴、瑟。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"竹　籥、簫、竾。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"匏　笙、竽。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"土　壎。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"革　鼓、鞀。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"木　柷、敔。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"十二律用周黍尺九寸管，空徑三分為本。道宗大康中，詔行秬黍所定升斗，嘗定律矣。其法大抵用古律焉。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大樂","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"自漢以來，因秦、楚之聲置樂府。至隋高祖詔求知音者，鄭譯得西域蘇祗婆七旦之聲，求合七音八十四調之說，由是雅俗之樂，皆此聲矣。用之朝廷，別於雅樂者，謂之大樂。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"晉高祖使馮道、劉昫冊應天太后、太宗皇帝，其聲器、工官與法駕，同歸於遼。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"聖宗統和元年，冊承天皇太后，童子弟子隊樂引太后輦至金鑾門。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"天祚皇帝天慶元年上壽儀：皇帝出東閤，鳴鞭，樂作；簾捲，扇開，樂止。太尉執臺，分班，太樂令舉麾，樂作；皇帝飲酒訖，樂止。應坐臣僚東西外殿，太樂令引堂上，樂升。大臣執臺，太樂令奏舉觴，登歌，樂作；飲訖，樂止。行臣僚酒遍，太樂令奏巡周，舉麾，樂作；飲訖，樂止。太常卿進御食，太樂令奏食遍，樂作；文舞入，三變，引出，樂止。次進酒，行臣僚酒，舉觴，巡周，樂作；飲訖，樂止。次進食，食遍，樂作；武舞入，三變。引出，樂止。扇合，簾下，鳴鞭，樂作；皇帝入西閤，樂止。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大樂器：本唐太宗七德、九功之樂。武后毀唐宗廟，七德、九功樂舞遂亡，自後宗廟用隋文、武二舞。朝廷用高宗景雲樂代之，元會，第一奏景雲樂舞。杜佑通典已稱諸樂並亡，唯景雲樂舞僅存。唐末、五代板蕩之餘，在者希矣。遼國大樂，晉代所傳。雜禮雖見坐部樂工左右各一百二人，蓋亦以景雲遺工充坐部；其坐、立部樂，自唐已亡，可考者唯景雲四部樂舞而已。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"玉磬，","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"方響，","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"搊箏，","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"筑，","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"臥箜篌，","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大箜篌，","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"小箜篌，","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大琵琶，","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"小琵琶，","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大五絃，","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"小五絃，","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"吹葉，","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大笙，","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"小笙，","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"觱篥，","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"簫，","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"銅鈸，","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"長笛，","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"尺八笛，","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"短笛。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"以上皆一人。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"毛員鼓，","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"連鞀鼓，","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"貝。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"以上皆二人，餘每器工一人。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"歌二人，","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"舞二十人，分四部：","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"景雲舞八人，","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"慶雲樂舞四人，","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"破陣樂舞四人，","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"承天樂舞四人。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大樂調：雅樂有七音，大樂亦有七聲，謂之七旦：一曰娑陀力，平聲；二曰雞識，長聲；三曰沙識，質直聲；四曰沙侯加濫，應聲；五曰沙臘，應和聲；六曰般贍，五聲；七曰俟利{竹建}，斛牛聲。自隋以來，樂府取其聲，四旦二十八調為大樂。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"娑陀力旦：","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"正宮，","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"高宮，","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"中呂宮，","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"道調宮，","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"南呂宮，","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"仙呂宮，","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"黃鍾宮。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"雞識旦：","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_79","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"越調，","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_80","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大食調，","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_81","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"高大食調，","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_82","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"雙調，","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_83","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"小食調，","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_84","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"歇指調，","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_85","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"林鍾商調。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_86","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"沙識旦：","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_87","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大食角，","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_88","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"高大食角，","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_89","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"雙角，","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_90","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"小食角，","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_91","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"歇指角，","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_92","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"林鍾角，","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_93","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"越角。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_94","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"般涉旦：","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_95","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"中呂調，","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_96","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"正平調，","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_97","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"高平調，","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_98","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"仙呂調，","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_99","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"黃鍾調，","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_100","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"般涉調，","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_101","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"高般涉調。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_102","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"右四旦二十八調，不用黍律，以琵琶絃協之。皆從濁至清，迭更其聲，下益濁，上益清。七七四十九調，餘二十一調失其傳。蓋出九部樂之龜茲部云。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_103","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大樂聲：各調之中，度曲協音，其聲凡十，曰：五、凡、工、尺、上、一、四、六、勾、合，近十二雅律，於律呂各闕其一，猶雅音之不及商也。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_104","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"散樂","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_105","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"殷人作靡靡之樂，其聲往而不反，流為鄭、衛之聲。秦、漢之間，秦、楚聲作，鄭、衛寖亡。漢武帝以李延年典樂府，稍用西涼之聲。今之散樂，俳優、歌舞雜進，往往漢樂府之遺聲。晉天福三年，遣劉昫以伶官來歸，遼有散樂，蓋由此矣。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_106","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"遼冊皇后儀：呈百戲、角觝、戲馬以為樂。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_107","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"皇帝生辰樂次：","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_108","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒一行　觱篥起，歌。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_109","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒二行　歌，手伎入。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_110","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒三行　琵琶獨彈。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_111","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"餅、茶、致語。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_112","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"食入，雜劇進。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_113","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒四行　闕。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_114","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒五行　笙獨吹，鼓笛進。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_115","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒六行　箏獨彈，築毬。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_116","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒七行　歌曲破，角觝。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_117","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"曲宴宋國使樂次：","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_118","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒一行　觱篥起，歌。","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_119","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒二行　歌。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_120","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒三行　歌，手伎入。","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_121","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒四行　琵琶獨彈。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_122","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"餅、茶、致語。","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_123","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"食入，雜劇進。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_124","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒五行　闕。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_125","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒六行　笙獨吹，合法曲。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_126","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒七行　箏獨彈。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_127","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒八行　歌，擊架樂。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_128","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"酒九行　歌，角觝。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_129","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"散樂，以三音該三才之義，四聲調四時之氣，應十二管之數。截竹為四竅之笛，以協音聲，而被之絃歌。三音：天音揚，地音抑，人音中，皆有聲無文。四時：春聲曰平，夏聲曰上，秋聲曰去，冬聲曰入。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_130","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"散樂器：觱篥、簫、笛、笙、琵琶、五絃、箜篌、箏、方響、杖鼓、第二鼓、第三鼓、腰鼓、大鼓、鞚、拍板。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_131","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"雜戲：自齊景公用倡優侏儒，至漢武帝設魚龍曼延之戲，後漢有繩舞、自刳之伎，杜佑以為多幻術，皆出西域。哇俚不經，故不具述。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_132","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"鼓吹樂","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_133","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"鼓吹樂，一曰短簫鐃歌樂，自漢有之，謂之軍樂。遼雜禮，朝會設熊羆十二案，法駕有前後部鼓吹，百官鹵簿皆有鼓吹樂。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_134","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"前部：","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_135","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"鼓吹令二人，","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_136","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"掆鼓十二，","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_137","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"金鉦十二，","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_138","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大鼓百二十，","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_139","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"長鳴百二十，","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_140","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"鐃十二，","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_141","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"鼓十二，","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_142","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"歌二十四，","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_143","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"管二十四，","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_144","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"簫二十四，","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_145","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"笳二十四。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_146","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"後部：","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_147","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"鼓吹丞二人，","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_148","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大角百二十，","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_149","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"羽葆十二，","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_150","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"鼓十二，","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_151","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"管二十四，","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_152","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"簫二十四，","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_153","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"鐃十二，","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_154","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"鼓十二，","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_155","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"簫二十四，","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_156","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"笳二十四。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_157","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"右前後鼓吹，行則導駕奏之，朝會則列仗，設而不奏。","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_158","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"橫吹樂","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_159","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"橫吹亦軍樂，與鼓吹分部而同用，皆屬鼓吹令。","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_160","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"前部：","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_161","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"大橫吹百二十，","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_162","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"節鼓二，","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_163","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"笛二十四，","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_164","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"觱篥二十四，","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_165","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"笳二十四，","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_166","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"桃皮觱篥二十四，","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_167","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"掆鼓十二，","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_168","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"金鉦十二，","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_169","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"小鼓百二十，","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_170","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"中鳴百二十，","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_171","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"羽葆十二，","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_172","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"鼓十二，","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_173","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"管二十四，","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_174","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"簫二十四，","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_175","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"笳二十四。","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_176","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"後部：","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_177","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"小橫吹百二十四，","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_178","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"笛二十四，","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_179","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"簫二十四，","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_180","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"觱篥二十四，","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_181","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"桃皮觱篥二十四。","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_54_182","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_54","textTraditional":"百官鼓吹、橫吹樂，自四品以上，各有增損，見儀衛志。自周衰，先王之樂寖以亡缺，周南變為秦風。始皇有天下，鄭、衛、秦、燕、趙、楚之聲迭進，而雅聲亡矣。漢、唐之盛，文事多西音，是為大樂、散樂；武事皆北音，是為鼓吹、橫吹樂。雅樂在者，其器雅，其音亦西云。","sentenceOrder":182}],"overrides":{}}